{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fe481233-8a5c-89f8-933b-fb2bf55d9eca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T18:02:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:59:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good evening. I know is after hours for City Hall, it's almost six, but I saw the message say this line is open for storm things. Is okay to call now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you're in the right place. This line stays up after the regular hours for storm stuff. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so is the storm drain in front of my house. Since the storm Friday and Saturday, three days now, it is gurgling. Like water talking, you know? And a smell comes up from it, sewer smell. No way I can leave the window open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:59:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gurgling and a sewer smell, got it. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:59:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One ninety-six Memorial Boulevard, on the Easton's Beach side. Doug Peckham."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One ninety-six Memorial Boulevard, Peckham. Okay. Is the drain itself backed up right now, water standing in the street, or just the noise and the smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:00:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right now no standing water, is dry in the street. But the noise, it is wicked loud when the wind pushes. And I am worried, because if it rains again, no way it takes the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Anything else you've noticed out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:00:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one more. Near the drain there is a manhole cover. It looks off by one inch, maybe. Is sitting higher on one side. Before it was flat, I walk there every day, I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a manhole cover sitting about an inch off, next to the drain. That one I'll flag too, since a shifted cover can be a hazard for cars and walkers. Is it in the travel lane or by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By the curb, but cars they go close. Somebody could trip also. I put a orange cone on top, from my garage, but the wind, it moves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good thinking with the cone. I'm writing this up: gurgling drain, sewer odor, cover raised on one side, one ninety-six Memorial Boulevard. I'll get it over to the crew that handles drains and covers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, can somebody call me back when it is done? I would like to know it is fixed. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-six. I've got that down. We'll have someone call you once the work is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You know, I am sitting here reading, I got a library book about chess openings. I am learning the Italian one now. Very slow, I lose to myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a tough opponent. Well, enjoy the book, Mr. Peckham. If the water starts coming up in the street, call back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will, yes. Thank you very much, good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T18:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good night."
    }
  ],
